 ### Can output keys be sorted?<a name="can-output-keys-be-sorted"></a>
 
-Yes. Pass `sort_keys=True` to write keys in sorted order at every level, including inline tables.
-The default is `False`, which preserves insertion order.
+Yes. Keys are written in sorted order at every level, including inline tables. Pass `sort_keys=False` to preserve insertion order.
+On this branch the default is `True`.
 
 ```python
 import tomli_w
 
-assert tomli_w.dumps({"b": 1, "a": 2}, sort_keys=True) == "a = 2\nb = 1\n"
+assert tomli_w.dumps({"b": 1, "a": 2}) == "a = 2\nb = 1\n"
 ```
 
